# NEVER add a /:slug catch-all here: it would swallow real files
# (favicon.ico, robots.txt, /_astro/*…). Explicit lines only.
# Exact-match rules first (faster), splats last.
# The 37 legacy article lines are appended at build time by
# src/integrations/legacy-redirects.mjs.

